{"hw":"ἐγκαλέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐγκαλέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐγκαλέω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">call in</b> a debt, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">17.44</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">An.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.7.33</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">31.6</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">36.14</span> </span>: generally, <b class=\"lex-tr\">demand</b> as one's due, <span class=\"gk\">ἀργύριον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.26</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">invoke</b>, <span class=\"gk\">τὴν τῶν θεῶν ἰατρείαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Str.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14.1.44</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">bring a charge</b> or <b class=\"lex-tr\">accusation against</b> a person:—Constr.: c. dat. pers. et acc. rei, <b class=\"lex-tr\">charge</b> something <b class=\"lex-tr\">against</b> one, <span class=\"gk\">φόνους ἐ. τινί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">El.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">778</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ap.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">26c</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἐ. ἔγκλημά τινι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hyp.</spa